  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0:\n- Added production SSH/SFTP and supervised rclone connectors.\n- Added EnumStorageType.Rclone and StorageFactory support.\n- IStorage.TryGetFileInfoAsync (lookup without exceptions) and IStorage.FlushToDiskAsync (fsync),\n  both with default implementations.\n- LocalStorage: faster folder listing, reads and writes at explicit offsets.\n- SSH.NET 2026.0.1 (fixes GHSA-mggc-4xg6-vcxf, GHSA-q939-rpr3-3284).\n- SmartInVenture.StorageLib.OpenSlide is deprecated and no longer published; 2.1.1 is its last version.\n\n2.1.0:\n- OpenSlide moved to a separate package: SmartInVenture.StorageLib.OpenSlide\n  (keeps this core package lean; the 11 MB of native imaging libs ship only with\n  the OpenSlide package now).\n- Core: IStorage abstraction; LocalStorage, MemoryStorage, WindowsMetaMemoryStorage;\n  Azure Blob / S3 / SSH connectors; throttling, caching; FuseFlags POSIX support.\n- (2.0.0) BREAKING: IStorage.ReadAsync/WriteAsync return Task<int> (bytes transferred).",
